<title>Px · ns</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light}
body{margin:0;background:#0b1220;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;}
.bar{background:#001D68;color:#fff;padding:10px 18px;font-size:13px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;}
.bar b{font-weight:700}.bar .tag{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;background:#76B900;color:#0c1207;font-weight:700;border-radius:4px;padding:3px 8px;}
.note{background:#e9edf3;color:#3a4453;font-size:12px;padding:8px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #d2d8e2;}
.stage{width:100%;overflow:auto;background:#f4f2ec;}
.canvas{position:relative;width:6px;height:6px;transform-origin:top left;background:#fff;}
.canvas img{-webkit-user-drag:none;user-select:none;}
</style>
<div class="bar"><b>Px actual</b> (Niagara Workbench Px Editor) <span class="tag">RÉPLICA</span></div>
<div class="note">Pantalla Px real reproducida desde el config.bog: <b>ns</b>. Plano, botones On/Off, LEDs de estado y etiquetas en las mismas posiciones.</div>
<div class="stage"><div class="canvas" id="cv">
<div style="position:absolute;left:2px;top:2px;width:2px;height:2px;display:flex;align-items:center;font-family:Arial,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;font-size:13px;color:#16233a;line-height:1.05;overflow:hidden;white-space:pre-wrap;">plain</div>
</div></div>
<script>function fit(){var cv=document.getElementById("cv");var w=cv.parentElement.clientWidth;var s=Math.min(1,w/6);cv.style.transform="scale("+s+")";cv.parentElement.style.height=(6*s)+"px";}
window.addEventListener("resize",fit);fit();</script>
